<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally steady on light to moderate demand and mostly moderate offerings. Select and Choice chuck and round cuts steady to weak, while rib and loin cuts steady to firm. Beef trimmings not established.-USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>157 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>    50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>14 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     106.97	107.10	100.74	100.33</p>
<p>Changes	   0.15	  0.13	 -0.20	  0.01</p>
<p>Rib	  163.33	162.97	151.18	151.71</p>
<p>Chuck	 72.66	 71.73	 73.85	 71.09</p>
<p>Round	 92.91	 92.91	 88.53	 88.53</p>
